<h2>Aside 1.8.0 for testers</h2>
<p>This tester release gives approved testers early access to four features.</p>
<h3>What you can test</h3>
<ul>
  <li>note styles</li>
  <li>live speaker labels</li>
  <li>icon motion</li>
  <li>panel placement</li>
</ul>
<h3>Getting access</h3>
<p>Activate your existing license, then request beta access in Settings &gt; License.</p>
<h3>When beta access ends</h3>
<p>Your regular license and saved notes remain accessible after beta access ends.</p>
